	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "USB Type-C receptacle 24-pin full-featured, HRO TYPE-C-31-M-04 (LCSC C129018). GEOMETRY REPLACED Task 14b with the LCSC/EasyEDA C129018 verified land pattern (easyeda2kicad --full). The physical M-04 is a HYBRID part: A-row = 12 SMD pads 0.3x0.9 at y=-3.11 (A1 left -> A12 right), B-row = 12 THROUGH-HOLE pins (0.4mm drills, staggered y=-1.19/-1.89, B1 at x=+2.8 -> B12 at x=-2.8), 4 oval THT shield legs (renamed SH to match symbol) + 2 NPTH 0.8mm locating pegs. The Task-14 approximation modeled it as an all-SMD two-row JAE-style land pattern (24 SMD pads at y=+/-2.5) which cannot accept the physical part's THT B-row/shield legs at all.")
